review_text:
i was debating whether i wanted to play this game or not for awhile after learning about it from a friend of mine, but decided to go ahead and give it a shot. i work night shifts so i decided to download it to my steam deck for portability. steam says its incompatible, but after installing the latest photon ge it works perfectly. you have to play at the lowest graphical settings, otherwise the deck over heats, but so far i havent had any major issues with it.

as of writing this review i have 40+ hours and my main class is level 65. i havent been the most efficient with my leveling, tbh, so im sure others can be further along by now than i am. ^~^;

tldr; the game is a lot of fun to play, even on the steam deck (you need photon ge to play it on deck, however)
